===Alternative forms===
* {{l|en|tobogin}}, {{l|en|toboggin}}

===Etymology===
The noun is attested since 1829, the verb since 1846. Both derive from {{uder|en|fr|tabaganne|}}, which derives from an {{uder|en|alg|-}} word, probably {{uder|en|mic|tepaqan|}} or {{uder|en|abe|dabôgan|}}, influenced by similar words in other Eastern Canadian Algonquian languages. The sense of "hat" is recorded since 1929 and is short for {{m|en|toboggan cap}} (1928), a cap suitable for wearing while [[toboggan#Verb|tobogganing]].<ref>[http://www.word-detective.com/2009/10/toboggan/ Word Detective: toboggan]</ref>

